{"text":"You see, when you're fearful, we spend more time worrying about things that don't yet exist and very little on building on what already does. The solution is not to eradicate fear. That would be nice, but fear does play a role in keeping us safe. The solution is to recognize fear with compassion and act in spite of it. That is what courage is, after all. Doing the thing you fear because what you are to gain is worth the risk. 12 years a slave was worth the risk. Now, after...","words":[{"text":"You","start":1.22,"end":1.8},{"text":"see","start":1.8,"end":2.16,"punct":","},{"text":"when","start":2.24,"end":2.34},{"text":"you're","start":2.34,"end":2.54},{"text":"fearful","start":2.54,"end":3.04,"punct":","},{"text":"we","start":4.34,"end":4.64},{"text":"spend","start":4.64,"end":4.86},{"text":"more","start":4.86,"end":5.08},{"text":"time","start":5.08,"end":5.54},{"text":"worrying","start":5.54,"end":5.88},{"text":"about","start":5.88,"end":6.22},{"text":"things","start":6.22,"end":6.92},{"text":"that","start":6.92,"end":7.22},{"text":"don't","start":7.22,"end":7.62},{"text":"yet","start":7.62,"end":8.0},{"text":"exist","start":8.0,"end":8.46},{"text":"and","start":8.46,"end":9.24},{"text":"very","start":9.24,"end":9.58},{"text":"little","start":9.58,"end":9.86},{"text":"on","start":9.86,"end":10.18},{"text":"building","start":10.18,"end":10.58},{"text":"on","start":10.58,"end":10.94},{"text":"what","start":10.94,"end":11.18},{"text":"already","start":11.18,"end":11.74},{"text":"does","start":11.74,"end":12.2,"punct":"."},{"text":"The","start":12.7,"end":12.9},{"text":"solution","start":12.9,"end":13.2},{"text":"is","start":13.2,"end":13.48},{"text":"not","start":13.48,"end":13.64},{"text":"to","start":13.64,"end":13.82},{"text":"eradicate","start":13.82,"end":14.3},{"text":"fear","start":14.3,"end":14.76,"punct":"."},{"text":"That","start":14.94,"end":15.02},{"text":"would","start":15.02,"end":15.16},{"text":"be","start":15.16,"end":15.3},{"text":"nice","st